{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE A TORSO. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire limbs and tattoos to get better at tennis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.poster.avif?t=1761303956\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.webm?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.mp4?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TORSO TENNIS is a grid-based action roguelike with autobattler-inspired shop and synergy systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  \ud83d\udcaa <strong>Acquire Limbs:</strong> Buy them, upgrade them, and YOINK them from defeated opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f<strong>Get Horrible Tattoos:</strong> passive boosts that alter your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfbe<strong>Break the Game</strong>: become a Tennis God.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Builds To Try:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn CRITTERS that serve tennis balls, upgrade them to max capacity for an extremely offensive build that showers your opponent with tennis balls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a debuff build by removing the limbs from your opponent and throwing TRASH onto their court.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go full Defense mode with a DINO build, protect your court with SHELLS, then find an opening to unleash a full clip of tennis balls.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"TENNIS CHAMP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2824780/a0c3f61ca7228ac64e4962b69bd525a84f4b0297.jpg"},{"name":"TENNIS GOD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2824780/5fed6c3ef9b8e1babc9e0df80cf9a583be4c4ac0.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2824780?t=1761303956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2824780?t=1761303956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/697f209ceb6a3c4d825b45b2f55b0d3ee98eae40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761303956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/697f209ceb6a3c4d825b45b2f55b0d3ee98eae40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761303956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE A TORSO. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire limbs and tattoos to get better at tennis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.poster.avif?t=1761303956\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.webm?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.mp4?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TO